<section class="hero">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>THE IYI PACKAGE DIRECTORY</div>
<h1>Find an iyi package.<br>Or write <em>the next one.</em></h1>
<p>The iyi standard library and every iyi module on GitHub, in one place.<br class="desktop">Crystal shards are supported too, with iyi build --crystal.</p>
<div class="hero-links">
<a class="text-link" href="#catalog">Explore the collection<span>↓</span></a>
<a class="text-link" href="https://shardbox.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find Crystal shards on Shardbox<span>↗</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<%# How a package arrives: the command, code that uses it, and what it prints. Real text, not a picture. -%>
<div class="hero-art">
<div class="art-label">EXAMPLE: HOW TO START USING A PACKAGE.</div>
<div class="art-term">
<div class="art-line"><span class="art-prompt">&gt;</span> iyi get github.com/sdogruyol/iyi-web --as web</div>
<div class="art-line art-out"><span class="art-ok">added</span> github.com/sdogruyol/iyi-web v0.6.0</div>
</div>
<div class="art-file">
<div class="art-name">your_app.iyi</div>
<div class="art-line art-add">import web/iyi_web/dsl::*</div>
<div class="art-line art-add">get "/" do |env|</div>
<div class="art-line art-add">&nbsp;&nbsp;"It works!"</div>
<div class="art-line art-add">end</div>
<div class="art-line art-add">run</div>
</div>
<div class="art-term">
<div class="art-line"><span class="art-prompt">&gt;</span> iyi run your_app.iyi</div>
<div class="art-line art-out">iyi-web is ready to lead at http://localhost:3000</div>
<div class="art-line"><span class="art-prompt">&gt;</span> curl localhost:3000</div>
<div class="art-line art-out">It works!</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="stats">
<span><b><%= total %></b> packages</span>
<span><b><%= categories.size %></b> categories</span>
<span><span class="dot"></span> Served by iyi</span>
<span class="stats-note">A small ecosystem. A good beginning.</span>
</div>

<section id="catalog" class="catalog">
<aside id="categories">
<div class="eyebrow">BROWSE BY CATEGORY</div>
<a class="category-link<%= category.empty? ? " active" : "" %>" href="/#catalog"><span>⊞ &nbsp; All packages</span><span><%= total %></span></a>
<% categories.each do |c| -%>
<a class="category-link<%= category == c.slug ? " active" : "" %>" href="/categories/<%= c.slug %>#catalog"><span><%= c.icon %> &nbsp; <%= c.name %></span><span><%= c.count %></span></a>
<% end -%>
<div class="aside-note">
<span>↗</span>
<h3>Made for builders.</h3>
<p>The standard library and the iyi modules on GitHub, with their numbers.</p>
<a href="/about">About this directory →</a>
</div>
</aside>

<div class="results">
<div class="section-title">
<h2 id="results-title"><%= category.empty? ? "Discover packages" : category_name(categories, category) %></h2>
<span id="results-count"><%= packages.size %> packages</span>
</div>

<form class="filters" id="filters" action="/#catalog" method="get">
<label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" name="q" value="<%= query %>" placeholder="Search packages…" aria-label="Search packages"><kbd>/</kbd></label>
<select name="category" aria-label="Category">
<option value="">All categories</option>
<% categories.each do |c| -%>
<option value="<%= c.slug %>"<%= category == c.slug ? " selected" : "" %>><%= c.name %></option>
<% end -%>
</select>
<select name="sort" aria-label="Sort order">
<% SORT_LABELS.each do |option| -%>
<option value="<%= option[0] %>"<%= sort == option[0] ? " selected" : "" %>><%= option[1] %></option>
<% end -%>
</select>
<button type="submit">Search →</button>
</form>

<div class="catalog-note"><span class="dot"></span>Numbers from GitHub, as imported. No invented popularity scores.</div>

<div class="package-grid" id="package-grid">
<% packages.each do |pack| -%>
<article class="package">
<div class="package-top"><span class="package-icon"><%= pack.slug[0, 1] %></span><span class="badge <%= badge_class(pack) %>"><%= badge(pack) %></span></div>
<h3><a href="/packages/<%= pack.slug %>"><%= pack.name %><span>↗</span></a></h3>
<p><%= pack.description %></p>
<p class="package-stats"><%= summary(pack, now) %></p>
<div class="package-bottom"><a href="/categories/<%= pack.category %>#catalog"><%= category_name(categories, pack.category) %></a></div>
</article>
<% end -%>
</div>

<% if packages.empty? -%>
<div class="empty" id="empty">
<h3>No packages found.</h3>
<p>Try another search or clear your filters.</p>
<a class="button" href="/#catalog">Clear filters ↗</a>
</div>
<% end -%>
</div>
</section>
